              "name": "Daisy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this for our group picnic potluck. Our hostess and other guests loved it--they liked the flavor that the mango added to the whole dish. I added some baby ruby red mix to the greens and some basil since I have it growing in a container. The basil enhanced the flavor. Allow the cubed watermelon to drip off excess juice before adding so as not to make the salad saggy with its juice.",
